(4,'KEEP',[I,II],'theory','Block collision with a massive axial Hooke spring','Total mass, axial spring stiffness, length and elastic impact are supplied. Discretizing an ordinary Hooke spring derives longitudinal waves and the end-mass boundary dynamics, with wave transit important for a light striker. No bending/tensor elasticity is required.'),
